[metadata]
Name:Payment reducers - activated Waterbend
Goal:Survive
Turns:4
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Do not play the Island or tap Giant Koi. Activate Waterbend 3, select Coral Merfolk, then Cancel: nothing is spent. Retry, select only Merfolk, and click the labeled Auto Pay button once: Merfolk and both Islands tap, with no duplicate reducer picker. Reset and pay entirely with Merfolk, Bears, and Short Sword: the last selection completes payment, leaving Koi and both Islands untapped. Resolve and attack past Walking Corpse.

